WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.207 --> 00:00:06.706
Today's One Minute Monday is: It's a marathon!

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:12.581
Running a business is not a sprint, it's a marathon and things... take... time to happen!

00:00:12.581 --> 00:00:16.750
No matter how hard you work, no matter how much effort you put in at the beginning,

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:21.064
it still will take time and you need to let time for that momentum to build.

00:00:21.064 --> 00:00:25.038
And too many entrepreneurs, they don't see results right away.

00:00:25.038 --> 00:00:29.404
They think it's going to be easy. You don't see results right away and so you quit.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:34.579
It's way better to spend 1 hour a day, but 1 hour every single day,

00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:40.200
doing something to grow your business than to cram everything in to a couple of weeks,

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.124
see no results and quit and go get a job.

00:00:43.124 --> 00:00:50.256
It's a marathon, it's not a sprint. Make sure you allow for time to build all your momentum up

00:00:50.256 --> 00:00:53.460
and do something every day to grow your company.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:54.928
Believe!

00:00:54.928 --> 00:00:57.519
If you liked this video, give it a thumbs up.

00:00:57.519 --> 00:00:59.735
Leave a comment below, I'll make a video response.

00:00:59.735 --> 00:01:01.705
Thank you so much! And I'll see you soon.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
